<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16 grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] md:gap-14">
    <h1 class="mb-0 mt-0 text-balance text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Freediving gives your life back.</h1>
    <img src="/images/home/circle.webp" alt="Freediver sitting above calm water" width="1400" height="900" class="aspect-[14/9] w-full rounded-xl object-cover">
  </header>

  <div class="grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-14">
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Deeper means calmer.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Equalize early, turn when planned and surface with enough reserve for a calm recovery breath.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Molchanovs Wave 1 and Wave 2 certification is available. In water, always train with an active, qualified buddy and stay within conservative limits.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Water teaches calm for life.</h2>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Children float, swim, glide and dive with a qualified instructor beside them, one skill at a time.</p>
    </section>
